{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108827","id":3248008292,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7BmKxk","number":108827,"title":"Undocumented interaction between `bind` and `unbind`","user":{"login":"AriaTheCurseling","id":105683700,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkya9A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105683700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling","html_url":"https://github.com/AriaTheCurseling","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AriaTheCurseling/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-21T10:11:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T13:41:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nDocumentation for version 4.4\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the documentation for bind and unbind, it has this singular example and explains that unbind doesn't affect bind\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tfoo.unbind(1).call(1, 2) # Calls foo(1).\n\tfoo.bind(3, 4).unbind(1).call(1, 2) # Calls foo(1, 3, 4), note that it does not change the arguments from bind.\n```\nWhile the example is correct, if you switch the order of bind and unbind then unbind *will* affect bound arguments\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint.bind(3, 4).unbind(1).call(1, 2) # Calls print(1, 3, 4)\n        print.unbind(1).bind(3, 4).call(1, 2) # Calls print(1, 2, 3)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108827/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}